<title>USA: Fuel-Tech NV Q3 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Fuel-Tech NV Q3 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Statements of Operations (Unaudited)</p>
<p>			     For the Three	  For the Nine</p>
<p>			     Months Ended	   Months Ended</p>
<p>		     9/30/96	9/30/95     9/30/96     9/30/95</p>
<p>Royalty income from joint</p>
<p>  venture	   $35,000     $35,000     $91,000    $114,000</p>
<p> Total expenses   920,000   1,337,000   2,011,000   3,038,000</p>
<p> Net loss	  (818,000) (1,255,000) (1,730,000) (2,678,000)</p>
<p>Net loss per common share</p>
<p>			 ( .07)	( .10)	( .14)	( .22)</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>of shares outstanding</p>
<p>		    12,381,821  12,371,240  12,379,441  12,343,289</p>
<p>NOTE: Included in the 1996 nine-month and three-month results is a non-recurring charge of $849,000 and $459,000 respectively, related to legal costs and the company's settlement of patent litigation.</p>
